*.db-shm

# GitHub Actions workflows are written and kept on disk (see
# docs/implementation-plan.md Phase 5) but this session's GitHub App
# token lacks the `workflows` OAuth scope, so GitHub rejects any push
# that touches .github/workflows/*. Ignored here so the repo state stays
# clean instead of showing them as perpetually untracked; once the app
# is granted `workflows` permission, remove this entry and commit them.
.github/workflows/
